    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "mlSlo",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Motion Notes",
      "width": 400,
      "height": 420,
      "content": "Apple motion\n\nButton/Primary: highlight on pointer-down, scale 0.97, 100ms. Never wait for click.\n\nLogin / Register: field focus ring is instant on pointer-down; error appears inline under the fields, no modal. Mode switch (登录 ↔ 注册) is a text action — no second primary button. Submit label swaps to 登录中 / 注册中 without locking the field. Prefer reduced-motion: keep color/opacity, drop scale.\n\nCouple / Unbound: copy invite → brief checkmark swap on the primary label (已复制), spring settle damping 1.0 / response 0.3. Bind submit → 绑定中 without locking the code field. Inline error under the input (expired / self / missing) — no modal.\n\nCouple / Bound: days number is the dominant region; anniversary row opens an edit sheet from the row (transform-origin = row). Unbind uses a confirm dialog: scrim materializes (blur+opacity together), dialog springs from 0.96→1, interruptible.\n\nSheets and drawers: spring damping 1.0, response 0.3. Interruptible from the live transform.\n\nPhoto grid: rubber-band at edges; project flick with d=0.998 then spring.\n\nChat: 1:1 with the pointer while dragging the thread; bounce only after a flick."
    },
