    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "O131wl",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 7242,
      "name": "Couple Design Notes",
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "content": "Web / Couple — design intent\n\nPurpose: bind two accounts into one space (Phase 1.2).\n\nStates:\n• Bound — pair + days is the dominant region; anniversary row opens Sheet/EditAnniv; Unbind is destructive ghost → Dialog/Unbind.\n• Unbound — invite code is primary share action; bind form is secondary after 或.\n• Bind Error — inline under input (expired / self / missing / already bound). Never modal.\n• Unbind — confirm dialog; Agency: cancel default, danger confirm.\n• Edit Anniv — sheet from bottom, transform-origin = anniversary row.\n\nMaterials: sidebar & toolbar already use backdrop blur; sheets/dialogs materialize blur+opacity together.\n\nDo not show invite code on Bound."
    }
  ],
